      "published": "Fri, 30 Oct 2026 12:39:19 +0000",
      "summary_raw": "<p>It’s election season. Contentious, confusing and consequential, from the US midterms to national polls in Taiwan, South Sudan and Gambia, and local elections in South Africa. Concrete examples from a definitive toolkit sets out how to cover it, accurately and effectively.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org/2026/10/rewriting-the-rules-newsroom-cpr-for-election-coverage-in-an-era-of-populism/\">Rewriting the rules: Newsroom CPR for election coverage in an era of populism</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org\">WAN-IFRA</a>.</p>",
